# street-facs-fighter-PKGBUILD

Arch Linux PKGBUILD for [street-facs-fighter](https://github.com/xsigil/street-facs-fighter).

## Installation

### Using an AUR Helper (once published)

```bash
yay -S street-facs-fighter-git
# or
paru -S street-facs-fighter-git

```

### Manual Build

```bash
git clone [https://github.com/](https://github.com/)<YOUR_USER>/street-facs-fighter-PKGBUILD.git
cd street-facs-fighter-PKGBUILD
makepkg -si

```
